<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-pre-raid-opening" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This list represents the best gear available in Mists of Pandaria Classic prior to Mogu'Shan Vaults opening and Celestial Dungeons becoming available. You'll swap to the <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=74724/enchant-weapon-jade-spirit">
<img alt="Enchant Weapon - Jade Spirit" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Jade Spirit</span></a> enchant once it is available.<br/>
<br/>
