<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="celestial-dungeon-gear">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_legendarygem_05.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Celestial Dungeon Gear for Discipline Priests</span></h2>This list represents the best gear available strictly from Celestial dungeons &amp; August Stone Fragments in Phase 1 of Mists of Pandaria Classic, although it's important to remember that combining item sources is the best way to gear early on. Players should sim the gear they actually have with QE Live in order to determine which pieces to wear. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Special Note: The Celestial Vendor also offers <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=86865/kritak-imperial-scepter-of-the-swarm">
<img alt="Kri'tak, Imperial Scepter of the Swarm" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_1h_pandaraid_d_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Kri'tak, Imperial Scepter of the Swarm</span></a> which is a stronger weapon but only once you've obtained <a class="q5 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89882/crystallized-horror">
<img alt="Crystallized Horror" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_legendary_breathofblackprince_str.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crystallized Horror</span></a> for its special Sha-Touched gem slot.</b>
<br/>
<br/>
